	(text "ADC Pins Selected (8 total):\n------------------------------------\n PA0  (pin 34)  → ADC1/2_IN1   - Fast sampling\n PA1  (pin 35)  → ADC1/2_IN2   - Fast sampling  \n PB0  (pin 56)  → ADC3_IN12    - Phase U current\n PB1  (pin 57)  → ADC3_IN1     - Phase V current\n PB11 (pin 70)  → ADC1/2_IN14  - Phase W current\n PB14 (pin 76)  → ADC4/5_IN4   - DC Bus voltage\n PB15 (pin 77)  → ADC4/5_IN5   - General purpose\n PC0  (pin 26)  → ADC1/2_IN6   - General purpose\n------------------------------------\n\nHRTIM Pins:\n------------------------------------\n PA8  → HRTIM_CHA1  (PHASE_U)\n PA9  → HRTIM_CHA2  (PHASE_UN)\n PA10 → HRTIM_CHB1  (PHASE_V)\n PA11 → HRTIM_CHB2  (PHASE_VN)\n PB12 → HRTIM_CHC1  (PHASE_W)\n PB13 → HRTIM_CHC2  (PHASE_WN)\n-------------------------------"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 134.874 41.91 0)
		(effects
